message: "If you use this observatory or its datasets, please cite it as below."
title: "Tamil Nadu Industrial Policy Outcomes Observatory"
authors:
  - family-names: "Mardia"
    given-names: "Sanchit"
type: dataset
date-released: "2026-10-20"
url: "https://smar98.github.io/tamil-nadu-industrial-policy-outcomes-observatory/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/smar98/tamil-nadu-industrial-policy-outcomes-observatory"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-led review of Tamil Nadu industrial-policy commitments and
  outcomes: 33 policies (2007-2026), 41 hand-coded headline commitments,
  disclosure-safe Annual Survey of Industries aggregates (2008-09 to 2023-24),
  and a public interactive evidence ledger that separates what was promised,
  what official data can measure, and where a verdict would overreach.
keywords:
  - industrial policy
  - Tamil Nadu
  - Annual Survey of Industries
  - policy evaluation
